---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Made Out of Clay Productions — Picture Books by Isaiah Hartwell"
metaTitle: "Children's Picture Books | Made Out of Clay"
description: "Premium full-color picture books for kids ages 2–7. Four heartfelt series — gentle, inclusive, sing-along, and made to be read again and again. By Isaiah Hartwell."
schemaOrg: true
schemaFaq: true
---
{% from "partials/book-card.njk" import bookCard %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent picture-book imprint</p>
      <h1>Stories for the kids who feel things deeply.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Premium full-color picture books across four heartfelt series — about patience, belonging, courage, and songs your kids will never stop singing.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/books/">Explore all books</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg" href="/series/just-the-way-you-are/">Meet the series</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="false">
      {% for heroBook in [books[0], books[3], books[7], books[6]] %}
      <picture>
        <source srcset="{{ heroBook.cover | assetVariant('avif') }}" type="image/avif">
        <source srcset="{{ heroBook.cover | assetVariant('webp') }}" type="image/webp">
        <img src="{{ heroBook.cover }}" alt="{{ heroBook.alt }}" width="200" height="200"{% if loop.first %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %} decoding="async">
      </picture>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="club-banner" aria-label="Digital Book Club">
  <div class="wrap club-banner-inner">
    <span class="club-float club-float-1" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
    <span class="club-float club-float-2" aria-hidden="true">📚</span>
    <span class="club-float club-float-3" aria-hidden="true">🖍️</span>
    <div class="club-copy">
      <span class="club-kicker">✨ Founding membership is free</span>
      <h2>Step inside the Digital&nbsp;Book&nbsp;Club</h2>
      <p>A cozy clubhouse where our characters read along, write a letter home every week, and cheer your kid on — plus free printables to color.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn-club" href="https://club.madeoutofclayprod.com/">
      <span class="btn-club-emoji" aria-hidden="true">📖</span>
      <span class="btn-club-text">Enter the Book&nbsp;Club</span>
      <span class="btn-club-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/trust.njk" %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Four series, one heart</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Every book stands on its own — pick the one that fits your kid today.</p>
    <div class="series-grid">
      {% for s in series %}
      <div class="series-card" style="--accent: {{ s.accent }}; --accent-soft: {{ s.accentSoft }}; --accent-text: {{ s.accentText or s.accent }};">
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p class="series-tag">{{ s.tagline }}</p>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
        <a class="series-link" href="/series/{{ s.slug }}/">Explore {{ s.name }} &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">The collection</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Nine hardcover titles are available on Amazon; <em>Titus and the Lions</em> is coming soon with a free preview.</p>
    <div class="book-grid">
      {% for book in books %}
        {{ bookCard(book, site, lookups.seriesBySlug[book.series].name) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/reviews.njk" %}

{% include "partials/faq.njk" %}

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
    <h2>New books &amp; free printables</h2>
    <p>Join the family list for new releases, coloring pages, and gentle reads for the kids you love.</p>
    {% set signupLocation = "homepage" %}
    {% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
